* 30_figure1_attitude_distribution.do — 态度变量分布直方图 (bank-year)
* 注 (2026-06-12 核对): 旧头注另称 "bank-year heatmap", 本模板实际仅实现
* histogram, 无 heatmap 代码 — 头注已更正为与实现一致。
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""     global data_dir "../data"
if "$figures_dir" == ""  global figures_dir "../output/figures"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

* 态度变量直方图
hist {{ATTITUDE_VAR}}, percent fcolor(navy%70) lcolor(white) ///
    xtitle("Operating-benefit attitude (Jha-Liu-Manela 2026)") ///
    title("Distribution of {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} (bank-year)") ///
    scheme(s2color)
graph export "$figures_dir/figure1_attitude_distribution.pdf", replace

display "[OK] Figure 1 → $figures_dir/figure1_attitude_distribution.pdf"
